Set up CI matrix build verification.

GitHub Actions workflow that builds on multiple platforms and compilers.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] CI builds on Ubuntu (GCC, Clang)
- [ ] CI builds on macOS (Apple Clang)
- [ ] CI builds on Windows (MSVC or MinGW)
- [ ] All build targets compile without errors
- [ ] Tests run and pass on all platforms
- [ ] Build matrix defined in .github/workflows/

## Test Plan
- [ ] Push to PR branch, verify all matrix jobs pass
- [ ] Verify each platform produces working executables
- [ ] Verify test results reported correctly
